    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vectōnes</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vettōnes</span></b> , um, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people of
			Lusitania</i>, in the modern <i>Salamanca</i> and <i>Estremadura</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3,
				4, § 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 20, 34, §
			112</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C. 1, 38</span></i>; Liv 35, 22, 8; <i><span class="en">Luc. 4,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 3, 378</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vet-tōnĭa</span></b> ,
				ae, f., <i>the territory
				of the Vettones</i>, Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 3, 187; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 383,
			7</span></i>.</div>
